# 生成物不入库；目录约定见 docs/DATA-MODEL.md
data/raw/*.jsonl
data/raw/*.jsonl.gz
data/baselines/*.json
results/alerts/*.json
results/watch/*.json
results/reports/*.md
results/reference/*.json
!data/raw/README.md
!data/raw/2026-10-17-transcripts/
